    <string name="diag_policy_title">Android Call Recording Policy</string>
    <string name="diag_policy_body">Since Android 9 (Pie) and Android 10, Google restricted third-party apps from directly tapping into raw cellular voice calls (VOICE_CALL audio source). This app uses legitimate Android APIs: AudioSource.VOICE_COMMUNICATION and AudioSource.MIC with hardware acoustic echo cancellation and automatic phone state detection. For best 2-way quality on Android 10+, turning on Speakerphone during calls allows capturing both sides cleanly.</string>

